+<section class="wrap section" id="faq"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><div class="answer">Absolutely. The Free plan is free forever, and Team comes with a 14-day free trial. No credit card required to get started.</div></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><div class="answer">Choose yearly billing and you’ll save 20% compared with paying month to month. The displayed price is the per-user monthly equivalent, billed annually.</div></details><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><div class="answer">Yes. Upgrade or downgrade any time from your workspace settings. When you upgrade, you’ll get access to the new features right away.</div></details><details><summary>What counts as a user?</summary><div class="answer">Each person with an active seat in your workspace is a user. You can invite or remove teammates whenever your team changes.</div></details><details><summary>Do you offer help setting up Relay?</summary><div class="answer">Business includes custom onboarding. Every plan also has access to our help center, and our team is happy to answer questions.</div></details></div></section></main>
